	(lib_symbols)
	(text "System Design Notes:\n\n• Analog and digital grounds joined at single star point under ADC.\n• +3V3_A generated via low-noise LDO (TPS7A47) from +V_IN.\n• +3V3_D derived from digital buck regulator.\n• +3V3_CLKGEN isolated via ferrite bead from +3V3_D.\n• ADC digital IO operates at 3.3V LVCMOS.\n• Clock jitter target < 1ps RMS."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
